    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490120032/4901200320010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、事務所に戻って書類仕事だ\r\nすぐ終わると思うけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901200320020,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "そっか……\r\nなら、これ食べるか？　その……仕事のお供にさ",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
